  lines:
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: (That must be the boss. We'll beat it, no matter what I lose.)
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 1047115457, guid: 37d55987ad413b240ab05e7a56eec345, type: 3}
    name: Lucius
    text: Is this the last boss? Can we leave once we beat it?
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 752313563, guid: 300db373928b38f45a1826963cc9dcc3, type: 3}
    name: Kairos
    text: Hopefully...
  - spriteImage: {fileID: 1047115457, guid: 37d55987ad413b240ab05e7a56eec345, type: 3}
    name: Lucius
    text: Let's do this. I can't wait to get out of here.
